Read .gitignore into a data structure.
Check .gitignore for syntax and sort order, and rewrite it if a command line option exists to do that.

Read .gitrepos into a data structure
Check .gitrepos for syntax and sort order, and agreement with .gitignore, and rewrite one, the other, or both if there's an issue.

Then do the add-nested or pull-nested logic and update the data structures and write them out.



.gitignore.serialize()
.gitignore.deserialize()

.gitrepos.serialize()
.gitrepos.deserialize()
